      "title": "Content-preserving migration into the config-first layout",
      "question": "Design the migration from today's de-facto layout (repo rules/, live rules, two skills trees, hooks/_dispatch/manifest.json) into the config-first layout WITHOUT destroying content, given that the divergence is two-directional.",
      "source_layout": {
        "roots": [
